                <div class="mb-3">
                    <label for="syncType" class="form-label"><i class="bi bi-arrow-repeat"></i> Sync Type</label>
                    <select id="syncType" class="form-select">
                        <option value="CONSIGNEE">CONSIGNEE</option>
                        <option value="PACKAGE">PACKAGE</option>
                        <option value="COURIER">COURIER</option>
                        <option value="KEY">KEY</option>
 <% if(setting && setting.is_premium){ %>
                        <option value="SHIPMENT">SHIPMENT</option>
                        <option value="COLLECTION">COLLECTION</option>
<% }; %>
                    </select>
                </div>
                <div class="mb-3">
                    <label for="link" class="form-label"><i class="bi bi-link-45deg"></i> <span id="label">Webhook URL</span></label>
                    <input type="text" id="link" class="form-control" placeholder="https://..." />
                    
                </div> <p>When clicking "Create Courier Sync" please note with the exception of the KEY a sample request will be sent to each hook and the response will be shown in the data key.</p>
               

                <button class="btn btn-success" onclick="createCourierSync()">
                    <i class="bi bi-plus-circle"></i> Create Courier Sync
                </button>

                <h2 class="mt-4"><i class="bi bi-file-earmark-code"></i> Response</h2>
                <pre id="response">Waiting for request...</pre>
